@startuml uml-seq-1-criar
!include _uml.iuml
title C4 Nível 4 / UML — Sequência 1: Inserir entrega (RF-03) com publicação de evento (código entregue)
autonumber
actor "Gerente de Logística" as G
participant "MFE Entregas\n(React)" as UI
box "Serviço de Entregas — Azure Functions" #EEF4FC
participant "createDelivery\n.function" as FN
participant "createDelivery\n.handler" as H
participant "CreateDelivery\nUseCase" as UC
participant "Delivery\n<<Entity>>" as E
participant "MongoDelivery\nRepository" as R
participant "ServiceBusDelivery\nEventPublisher" as P
end box
database "MongoDB Atlas" as DB
queue "Azure Service Bus" as SB

G -> UI : preenche formulário e salva
UI -> FN : POST /api/deliveries (JSON)
FN -> H : handler(request)
H -> H : readJsonBody(request)
H -> UC : execute(payload)
UC -> E : Delivery.create(props, now)
alt dados inválidos
  E --> UC : ValidationError
  UC --> H : ValidationError
  H --> FN : 400 { message }
else dados válidos
  E --> UC : delivery
  UC -> R : insert(delivery)
  R -> DB : insertOne()
  DB --> R : insertedId
  R --> UC : delivery + _id
  UC -> P : publish(DeliveryCreated)
  P -> SB : sendMessages(subject=DeliveryCreated)
  SB --> P : ack
  UC --> H : delivery
  H --> FN : 201 Created (JSON)
end
FN --> UI : resposta HTTP
UI --> G : exibe entrega na tabela
note over UI, FN : Na arquitetura-alvo a chamada passa por\nAPI Gateway e BFF Web (ver Sequência 4).
@enduml
